                                "sense_id": "95cd0864-4278-30de-bb25-eeb80786c0e4",
                                "text": "It [the plan] was bullish about the prospects for BR winning new business and retaining what it had, but recognised that this would depend on the extent to which equipment would enable improved services at lower costs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
